### BASE URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084

### 1) HEALTH CHECK
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 2) CREATE AUDIT LOG
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/log
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"userId": "u-1001",
	"action": "LOGIN_SUCCESS",
	"type": "AUTH",
	"details": "User logged in with MFA",
	"severity": "INFO",
	"sourceService": "auth-service"
}

### 3) CREATE ANOTHER LOG (WALLET EXAMPLE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/log
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"userId": "u-1001",
	"action": "DEPOSIT_APPROVED",
	"type": "WALLET",
	"details": "Deposit of 50 credits approved",
	"severity": "INFO",
	"sourceService": "wallet-service"
}

### 4) LIST ALL LOGS
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/logs

### 5) FILTER LOGS BY USER AND TYPE
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/logs?userId=u-1001&type=AUTH

### 6) FILTER LOGS BY DATE RANGE (ISO-8601)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/logs?fromDate=2026-04-01T00:00:00&toDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59

### 7) GENERATE AUDIT REPORT
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/reports/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Weekly Security Report",
	"generatedBy": "admin-user",
	"fromDate": "2026-04-01T00:00:00",
	"toDate": "2026-04-14T23:59:59"
}

### 8) LIST REPORTS
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/reports

### 9) GENERATE AUDIT REPORT (LAST 24H EXAMPLE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/reports/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Last 24 Hours Report",
	"generatedBy": "audit-admin",
	"fromDate": "2026-04-13T00:00:00",
	"toDate": "2026-04-14T00:00:00"
}

